; case: atomic-observation
; verdict: accept
; ambiguous: no
; tests: externality=pass implementation-independence=pass non-prescription=pass
; rationale: Constrains what an observation may be, not how it is obtained. A native wide
;   read, a retry sequence and a firmware call all satisfy it or fail it observably.
; other-side: engine: native wide read, high/low/high retry, synchronization, or firmware-
;   mediated access
;
(defservice time.monotonic
  (requires
    (observation-coherent true)))
